/P 189 0 R
/E (The system has successfully analyzed the song lyrics to identify the tone of the emotions in the lyrics using Natural Language Processing and Machine Learning algorithms. It processes the text data by analyzing it in terms of preprocessing, feature extraction, and prediction to identify the emotions in the text, such as happy, sad, and angry. This application has successfully provided an interface for the user in a simple manner while giving accurate output. This project has shown the potential of Al in understanding human emotions.)
